WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:10.650
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka de

00:00.520 --> 00:10.650
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

00:19.160 --> 00:25.540
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

00:19.160 --> 00:25.540
In a world without words, we speak of love

00:25.540 --> 00:29.500
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

00:25.540 --> 00:29.500
until it reaches you someday.

00:32.340 --> 00:39.220
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

00:32.340 --> 00:39.220
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

00:39.220 --> 00:44.890
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

00:39.220 --> 00:44.890
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

00:45.140 --> 00:51.860
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

00:45.140 --> 00:51.860
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

00:52.240 --> 00:58.030
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

00:52.240 --> 00:58.030
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

00:58.410 --> 01:06.580
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

00:58.410 --> 01:06.580
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

01:06.580 --> 01:13.260
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

01:06.580 --> 01:13.260
I want to take you somewhere far away,

01:13.260 --> 01:16.680
doko made yukeru

01:13.260 --> 01:16.680
and go anywhere,

01:16.680 --> 01:24.270
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

01:16.680 --> 01:24.270
to a place where we can believe in love.

01:35.820 --> 01:40.700
Kanji writing test
15 minutes

01:47.570 --> 01:50.240
Last night, I broke my curfew.

01:52.810 --> 01:56.200
Ritsuka... my Ritsuka wasn't like that!

01:56.200 --> 01:58.180
Wasn't that kind of child!

01:58.660 --> 02:02.760
I feel bad for Mother, but there
was no way I could go home...

02:03.500 --> 02:05.140
Not after that...

02:05.990 --> 02:06.930
Soubi!

02:07.510 --> 02:08.580
Can you stand?

02:08.580 --> 02:09.650
I can't...

02:11.110 --> 02:12.030
Damn!

02:14.150 --> 02:15.530
What are you doing?

02:23.240 --> 02:24.660
So, you're Loveless.

02:25.460 --> 02:28.120
Tomorrow, late afternoon,
we fight two against two.

02:29.340 --> 02:30.450
Seimei...

02:31.120 --> 02:33.960
Will I be able to fight like you?

02:33.960 --> 02:35.090
Hey, Aoyagi?

02:37.530 --> 02:38.770
What's wrong?

02:39.150 --> 02:40.760
You haven't put your name down yet.

02:42.350 --> 02:44.600
Name

02:42.350 --> 02:44.600
Year 6 Class No.

02:42.350 --> 02:44.600
Kanji Writing Test

02:42.350 --> 02:44.600
Rewrite the katakana to kanji.

02:42.350 --> 02:44.600
Use the space provided.

02:55.740 --> 02:57.570
Okay, you got it?

02:57.570 --> 02:59.650
Computer Lab

02:58.400 --> 03:02.200
We need to decide the three top news stories
for this semester's school paper.

03:02.200 --> 03:03.870
Talk it over carefully.

03:04.340 --> 03:08.040
By big news would be something like
Cat Land's mass escape incident...

03:08.040 --> 03:10.800
...the arrest of the
serial panty thief, and also...

03:10.800 --> 03:12.830
How about Ritsuka moving to this school?

03:14.190 --> 03:17.720
Him moving to this school has nothing
to do with this, don't you think?

03:17.720 --> 03:19.260
It's too personal!

03:19.380 --> 03:21.050
And also, that lunch with Ritsuka!

03:21.050 --> 03:21.840
That's right...

03:21.840 --> 03:23.720
Yuiko, sorry. Take care of the rest.

03:23.720 --> 03:25.720
Okay. Going to the bathroom?

03:25.720 --> 03:26.480
I'm going home.

03:29.360 --> 03:30.420
Aoyagi!

03:40.530 --> 03:41.740
Nice to see you again!

03:43.720 --> 03:47.140
I thought the battle was at dusk...

03:47.780 --> 03:50.960
It is. But before that,
let's have a tea break.

03:50.960 --> 03:52.500
My treat.

03:52.500 --> 03:54.860
I have nothing to say to you!

03:58.410 --> 04:00.530
You are similar to Seimei.

04:01.410 --> 04:02.380
You know Seimei?

04:03.330 --> 04:06.350
He told me the same thing,
in an annoying manner.

04:07.580 --> 04:09.810
I don't have anything to say to you.

04:10.410 --> 04:12.000
Like that...

04:12.000 --> 04:14.550
That guy, he totally underestimated us.

04:14.550 --> 04:15.810
A total prick.

04:15.990 --> 04:18.290
Seimei's not that type of guy!

04:18.290 --> 04:20.020
You must've made him mad!

04:20.020 --> 04:21.920
I didn't do anything!

04:21.920 --> 04:23.490
Seimei's the prick type.

04:23.670 --> 04:25.240
No, he's not!

04:25.240 --> 04:27.200
You don't know anything about Seimei!

04:29.320 --> 04:30.550
Who knows.

04:30.550 --> 04:32.160
You might be the one who
didn't know anything about him.

04:47.230 --> 04:50.950
This skin that doesn't feel pain...

04:52.280 --> 04:57.530
Clenching a fist, or holding a cup...
That means she has a sense of touch.

04:59.670 --> 05:03.300
What are you staring at,
you truant grade schooler?

05:03.300 --> 05:05.200
Y-You're the one who dragged me here!

05:06.370 --> 05:08.110
I lied before.

05:09.340 --> 05:10.930
You're not similar at all...

05:12.650 --> 05:14.250
To Seimei Aoyagi.

05:17.390 --> 05:20.610
I'm Seimei's brother...

05:21.220 --> 05:24.920
I'm sure I'll grow as tall
as Seimei, and stronger, too!

05:25.010 --> 05:27.390
It's better that you're not like him.

05:27.780 --> 05:30.030
Don't say bad things about Seimei!

05:30.520 --> 05:33.300
You're like Kouya in that respect.

05:35.550 --> 05:37.520
Stubborn and pure.

05:46.890 --> 05:50.500
When I first met her,
Kouya was in 6th grade, too.

05:52.300 --> 05:55.420
Hi, I'm Nakano Yamato...

05:56.160 --> 05:57.120
I've been waiting for you all this time.

05:58.110 --> 05:59.080
All this time?

06:01.130 --> 06:05.200
You know, I understand how
Agatsuma feels a little...

06:05.760 --> 06:09.250
I was told about Kouya all the time.

06:10.390 --> 06:11.880
I waited to meet her...

06:12.280 --> 06:15.130
I knew I was to become Kouya's...

06:16.360 --> 06:18.310
Soubi's not mine...

06:19.720 --> 06:21.120
Oh really?

06:23.100 --> 06:24.860
Poor Agatsuma!

06:25.130 --> 06:26.410
What are you saying?

06:26.410 --> 06:27.490
What's this?

06:27.650 --> 06:28.920
Don't touch me!

06:29.830 --> 06:31.990
Really, what happened?

06:37.230 --> 06:37.960
Nothing.

06:40.000 --> 06:41.190
It's fine...

06:42.120 --> 06:43.950
It's just that it doesn't hurt...

06:45.020 --> 06:47.830
I was hoping it would hurt at least once.

06:48.750 --> 06:52.220
Well, then it's the same
thing for me here, right?

06:52.220 --> 06:53.250
Yamato?

07:01.750 --> 07:02.880
It's the same, right?

07:03.840 --> 07:07.440
Kouya's, as well as mine.

07:07.610 --> 07:08.520
Yamato!

07:09.560 --> 07:13.660
You doing such a thing... even
if your wrist doesn't hurt...

07:15.300 --> 07:16.690
...it hurts me here...

07:18.460 --> 07:21.610
Hey, so, where's your name?

07:21.980 --> 07:23.510
Tell me.

07:23.510 --> 07:25.410
Name?

07:26.080 --> 07:28.920
There's the name "Loveless"
somewhere on your body, right?

07:29.840 --> 07:30.880
Name...

07:33.040 --> 07:37.520
I don't have any such thing.

07:38.340 --> 07:41.090
Maybe it's somewhere that's
hard to find on your own?

07:41.560 --> 07:43.360
What do you mean by that?

07:43.850 --> 07:45.710
I'll find it for you!

07:45.710 --> 07:46.480
No thanks!

07:47.470 --> 07:49.030
The name is important.

07:50.120 --> 07:53.570
Two people with the same
name is extra special.

07:54.360 --> 07:56.080
It's your fated companion.

07:57.860 --> 08:01.870
It's important, like
the heavens decided it.

08:01.870 --> 08:04.260
I don't like things like that.

08:04.260 --> 08:06.660
I want to decide everything myself.

08:06.660 --> 08:10.580
Isn't it up to you who you want
to be with... and not your name?

08:11.840 --> 08:13.140
Strange kid!

08:13.720 --> 08:14.970
It's a wonderful thing.

08:16.160 --> 08:17.930
By the way, mine is here.

08:18.590 --> 08:19.430
Wanna see?

08:19.760 --> 08:20.350
Huh?

08:21.400 --> 08:22.230
Hot!

08:23.830 --> 08:27.350
Um, excuse me, the use of cellphones
in the library is prohibited...

08:27.770 --> 08:28.410
Oh...

08:38.440 --> 08:38.870
Yes.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.410
Soubi?

08:40.820 --> 08:41.510
Yes...

08:42.560 --> 08:46.440
I didn't think I'd ever
be calling you, but...

09:09.870 --> 09:12.200
Kouya, did it come out?

09:12.200 --> 09:14.360
It did, on my chest.

09:15.800 --> 09:16.790
Oh, really?

09:17.240 --> 09:18.400
Mine's on my chest too.

09:20.730 --> 09:22.210
It's true.

09:22.670 --> 09:24.070
The same name.

09:25.320 --> 09:25.930
Yeah.

09:27.270 --> 09:29.370
Small chest.

09:29.370 --> 09:30.580
Shut up.

09:31.630 --> 09:32.630
...as I thought...

09:33.070 --> 09:35.760
Every time I fight,
my name gets lighter...

09:37.160 --> 09:39.120
Why is it only me?

09:40.090 --> 09:43.220
You're the test type of the Zero Series...

09:43.220 --> 09:45.680
...so there are still a few
bugs in your genetic structure.

09:46.080 --> 09:48.880
I don't want to be different from Kouya...

09:50.360 --> 09:53.360
Zero collapsed as soon
as the battle began?

09:53.730 --> 09:57.940
In that case, it only
pertains to battles between zeros.

09:57.940 --> 09:59.330
It won't affect you.

09:59.830 --> 10:01.280
What happened?

10:02.250 --> 10:04.330
Switching Sacrifices.

10:05.710 --> 10:06.550
Switching?

10:07.530 --> 10:11.680
Switching your Sacrifice
with the opponent's Sacrifice.

10:12.600 --> 10:14.920
I didn't know that was possible.

10:15.820 --> 10:17.390
As a result from switching...

10:17.390 --> 10:22.260
...the enemy's Sacrifice receives
the attack of its own Sentouki.

10:23.640 --> 10:25.920
It could be fatal.

10:25.920 --> 10:26.890
The spell?

10:26.980 --> 10:28.260
Who knows?

10:29.000 --> 10:30.600
Probably along the lines of "separation"...

10:32.980 --> 10:38.820
I will sever bonds with you
and forge bonds with him.

10:40.220 --> 10:41.650
Goodbye, Yamato...

10:44.500 --> 10:45.490
Goodbye.

10:46.520 --> 10:50.940
It could be reverted after the
battle, but when put into words...

10:50.940 --> 10:53.810
...the psychological damage will
remain for the side who activates it.

10:55.530 --> 10:58.180
To sever the bond of one's
name, even for a second...

10:58.180 --> 10:59.670
...is such an unreasonable thing.

11:02.950 --> 11:07.460
For I, who is controlled by
a name... is it trifling?

11:08.690 --> 11:14.790
But this name is what has given me her.

11:17.350 --> 11:21.950
And now, this name will take her away...

11:22.440 --> 11:25.250
Soubi, why don't you come
to this side once in a while?

11:25.250 --> 11:26.250
No thank you.

11:28.260 --> 11:31.960
Acting presumptuous,
thinking he has a master...

11:33.040 --> 11:34.950
Switching Sacrifices...

11:35.860 --> 11:37.640
Why did they fight like that?

11:41.240 --> 11:45.220
Soubi and her always look hurt...

11:46.150 --> 11:47.370
Why?

11:48.990 --> 11:50.180
It's cold...

11:55.810 --> 11:57.400
Sorry for the wait!

12:01.400 --> 12:02.410
What?

12:03.220 --> 12:04.450
Still stained?

12:04.670 --> 12:06.350
No, nothing.

12:07.520 --> 12:10.060
I'm a little relieved.

12:11.240 --> 12:13.120
You're a normal kid.

12:14.450 --> 12:19.280
I was worried you were
crafty and sinister, like Seimei.

12:21.180 --> 12:23.010
That's why you came to see me?

12:27.080 --> 12:31.480
I think I found out what your secret is.

12:47.140 --> 12:50.720
I'll try and make this battle quick...

12:51.790 --> 12:55.220
Zero won't feel the pain,
but Ritsuka, you will.

12:56.050 --> 12:57.840
I think that's wrong.

12:59.870 --> 13:02.250
They do have a sense of touch.

13:02.250 --> 13:05.380
Nerves are running through their bodies.

13:05.380 --> 13:07.640
It's not that they don't feel pain...

13:08.410 --> 13:13.230
...but something's deadening the
pain signals in their brain.

13:13.880 --> 13:14.950
What do you mean?

13:15.520 --> 13:18.060
I mean, they are humans, like us...

13:19.160 --> 13:21.520
Don't get confused by the name zero.

13:21.520 --> 13:24.050
Make them hurt without
physically injuring them.

13:24.050 --> 13:25.200
But that...

13:25.470 --> 13:26.860
Just try it!

13:30.360 --> 13:31.330
Okay.

13:32.150 --> 13:36.000
I think the pain will change something.

13:36.540 --> 13:38.050
Pain, huh...

13:38.670 --> 13:40.030
I like that word.

13:46.090 --> 13:48.920
I declare this to be a spell battle.

13:48.920 --> 13:49.970
I accept.

13:52.730 --> 13:56.940
Land, tear into two and
roar with a magnitude of 9.9!

14:02.900 --> 14:03.500
Ritsuka!

14:03.500 --> 14:05.280
It's okay! Do what we planned!

14:07.210 --> 14:11.280
Formed through pain, needles
that fall into this world!

14:14.180 --> 14:17.060
Pulsating pain itself
is the proof of life...

14:17.570 --> 14:19.500
Turn into rain and
pour down on the target!

14:21.170 --> 14:23.350
It doesn't matter to us...

14:24.170 --> 14:26.610
We don't have such feelings.

14:27.980 --> 14:29.710
That's right.

14:29.710 --> 14:32.350
Kouya, just restrict them.

14:32.520 --> 14:33.560
Roger.

14:34.760 --> 14:39.020
One tears into two, and from
three sides, takes four limbs!

14:43.080 --> 14:48.410
Grade school student, because you
can't take it, your Sentouki suffers.

14:48.940 --> 14:51.120
Because you fight your name...

14:52.030 --> 14:53.970
Don't hold back, lady!

14:53.970 --> 14:55.370
You're the one who's suffering!

14:57.100 --> 15:01.880
Flow from all the pierced
needles, veins of electricity...

15:02.430 --> 15:04.090
...100,000 volts of electric shock!

15:06.470 --> 15:07.670
It's no use.

15:14.880 --> 15:15.900
Yamato?

15:15.900 --> 15:18.680
It's nothing, I just tripped.

15:22.740 --> 15:24.480
The old lady cannot be forgiven...

15:24.660 --> 15:25.520
Finish them off!

15:26.750 --> 15:28.070
Restriction!

15:29.160 --> 15:31.110
Limit the freedom of the target.

15:32.980 --> 15:34.030
Denied!

15:34.030 --> 15:35.880
Kouya, focus.

15:35.880 --> 15:37.410
There's no strength in your spells.

15:38.970 --> 15:42.010
Not knowing pain, and living
life like a dead woman...

15:42.010 --> 15:43.880
...there's no way you
can win against me.

15:45.120 --> 15:47.590
Don't get sucked in,
Kouya. He's provoking you!

15:48.010 --> 15:51.610
You over there... It looks like you're alive.

15:51.610 --> 15:53.760
I can see the suffering in your face.

15:56.280 --> 15:57.180
What are you...

15:58.260 --> 16:02.190
Precious butterflies, pierced
by pins and turned into specimens...

16:04.060 --> 16:04.730
Yamato?

16:06.770 --> 16:07.520
The finishing strike...

16:07.520 --> 16:08.750
Stop!

16:10.060 --> 16:12.700
Stupid! Soubi, that's too much!

16:12.700 --> 16:14.110
You're in pain, aren't you?

16:14.580 --> 16:18.120
When the coffee was
spilled, you said "hot"...

16:18.120 --> 16:19.750
In truth, you do feel it!

16:21.230 --> 16:21.910
Yamato...

16:25.080 --> 16:27.920
Kouya, don't get sucked in...

16:38.320 --> 16:39.890
This doesn't hurt.

16:40.880 --> 16:42.850
Yamato, don't tell me...

16:44.300 --> 16:45.310
I'm telling you it doesn't hurt.

16:45.510 --> 16:46.370
Let me see!

16:46.370 --> 16:47.400
Let me see your name!

16:51.700 --> 16:52.610
It's gone...

16:53.520 --> 16:54.390
Why...

16:55.120 --> 16:55.820
Since when?

16:56.180 --> 16:59.390
Why, Yamato?

16:59.390 --> 17:01.080
Why?

17:01.080 --> 17:02.410
That's what I want to know!

17:06.700 --> 17:07.590
Why?

17:09.230 --> 17:10.790
Why only me?

17:13.270 --> 17:17.740
I'd rather die than be a burden to you...

17:18.650 --> 17:20.510
Okay! We're done, we're done!

17:20.930 --> 17:23.980
Ritsuka, we have to finish them off.

17:24.110 --> 17:25.720
I'm telling you it's okay!

17:25.720 --> 17:27.400
We won't fight an unnecessary fight!

17:28.710 --> 17:30.070
At times like these, Seimei would...

17:30.230 --> 17:33.240
Are you going to listen to me or not?

17:33.240 --> 17:34.150
Choose!

17:37.540 --> 17:38.470
You two...

17:40.500 --> 17:42.000
Will you concede the battle?

17:45.060 --> 17:46.120
We concede...

17:50.030 --> 17:52.850
For a Sentouki, that
means death. Are you sure?

17:55.900 --> 17:56.430
Yes.

18:02.170 --> 18:03.510
Then I have no business with you.

18:04.810 --> 18:05.810
We're done!

18:11.420 --> 18:12.550
It's the end.

18:13.620 --> 18:15.620
I can't be with Kouya anymore...

18:17.490 --> 18:23.630
Not just me... I wish everything would end.

18:30.150 --> 18:31.830
Even when your name disappears...

18:33.190 --> 18:34.690
Even if you're not Zero anymore...

18:36.050 --> 18:37.220
You love me?

18:44.990 --> 18:49.270
Will you die with me?

18:51.050 --> 18:54.900
Fine, if you want that.

18:56.050 --> 18:59.860
It's the first time I've seen you cry.

19:02.690 --> 19:05.490
I've always thought of dying...

19:06.870 --> 19:10.700
Living is a lot of work...

19:12.990 --> 19:16.250
As long as I'm with Yamato, I can die.

19:18.830 --> 19:22.180
I love you alive...

19:23.140 --> 19:25.660
I love you alive and warm...

19:27.090 --> 19:29.260
I love you laughing and crying...

19:30.410 --> 19:34.240
But if I can't be with you alive...

19:36.390 --> 19:37.430
Yamato...

19:38.600 --> 19:43.890
You're my Sacrifice,
and my destiny...

19:44.480 --> 19:45.950
I'm very happy!

19:47.540 --> 19:55.960
Yes, I love Yamato more
than my worthless self.

20:01.580 --> 20:03.620
How did it go?

20:03.620 --> 20:05.500
Of course you won, right?

20:07.230 --> 20:08.090
Professor Nagisa...

20:08.430 --> 20:08.930
Hmm?

20:09.980 --> 20:11.550
Zero died...

20:11.550 --> 20:12.320
Huh?

20:12.940 --> 20:13.650
Good bye.

20:14.360 --> 20:15.190
Hey!

20:15.450 --> 20:17.070
What's going on? I don't get it!

20:20.350 --> 20:21.030
Kouya...

20:23.780 --> 20:27.520
I'll always defend you.

20:30.290 --> 20:32.960
"Let's be reborn"

20:33.380 --> 20:36.240
Kouya, are you shaking?

20:36.910 --> 20:40.420
Because, it was my first time
talking back to Professor Nagisa.

20:45.750 --> 20:47.300
Pleased to meet you, Kouya...

20:49.960 --> 20:51.520
Same to you, Yamato.

20:53.000 --> 20:57.550
We died tonight. I wonder if
it means we were reborn tonight.

20:57.550 --> 21:00.940
Kouya, what are you talking about?

21:03.300 --> 21:05.490
That's a Sentouki and a Sacrifice.

21:06.720 --> 21:08.340
They can't live apart...

21:09.120 --> 21:11.770
Even you and Seimei?

21:12.620 --> 21:13.460
Yes.

21:15.820 --> 21:17.880
...Seimei was the only one to me.

21:19.450 --> 21:21.450
Although it was not true for Seimei...

21:22.140 --> 21:23.350
Seimei...

21:24.040 --> 21:28.910
Maybe Soubi was just a tool to you...

21:29.850 --> 21:34.770
To be continued...

21:31.010 --> 21:40.570
Setsunasa no kagiri made dakishimete mo

21:31.010 --> 21:40.570
Even if I hold you with all my suffering,

21:41.440 --> 21:50.950
itsu made mo hitotsu ni wa narenakute

21:41.440 --> 21:50.950
we still can't be one.

21:51.540 --> 22:01.460
Yasashisa yori fukai basho de fureau no wa itami dake

21:51.540 --> 22:01.460
The only thing that we can feel deep within besides kindness is pain,

22:01.880 --> 22:09.470
futari wo musunde kudasai

22:01.880 --> 22:09.470
so please, bind the two of us together.

22:12.010 --> 22:16.850
Bokura wa mou yume wo minai

22:12.010 --> 22:16.850
We no longer dream anymore,

22:16.850 --> 22:21.980
tomadoinagara te wo totte

22:16.850 --> 22:21.980
when you're wavering, take my hand

22:22.270 --> 22:31.200
zankoku na yoake no hou e arukidasu

22:22.270 --> 22:31.200
as we tread towards the cruel light of dawn.

22:32.330 --> 22:42.340
Hontou no kotoba wa kitto hontou no sekai no dokoka

22:32.330 --> 22:42.340
I'm sure real words are somewhere in the real world.

22:42.670 --> 22:51.550
Bokura no mukuchi na yoru ni hisonderu

22:42.670 --> 22:51.550
They lurk in the shadows of our silent nights.

22:51.930 --> 22:57.060
Ima mo kitto

22:51.930 --> 22:57.060
Surely, even now...

23:01.080 --> 23:02.110
Yokohama...

23:02.110 --> 23:06.420
Again in this city, men and
women meet, and also separate.

23:07.210 --> 23:10.600
Aoyagi, the time has
finally come to settle this!

23:10.600 --> 23:13.120
T-That's awkward,
suddenly asking me out...

23:13.720 --> 23:16.190
W-Who's going to confess
their love for you?

23:16.190 --> 23:17.620
Ritsuka Aoyagi, it's a duel!

23:17.840 --> 23:20.330
Tale eleven, Warless.

23:20.330 --> 23:22.920
The one who wins gets
to have Yuiko's ears!

23:22.920 --> 23:24.840
Hey now.
